Association StudentSpecialEducationProgramAssociation based on GeneralStudentProgramAssociation
    documentation "This association represents the special education program(s) that a student participates in or receives services from. The association is a subclass of the GeneralStudentProgramAssociation specifically designed for special education programs."
    bool IdeaEligibility
        documentation "Indicator of the eligibility of the student to receive special education services according to the Individuals with Disabilities Education Act (IDEA)."
        is optional
    descriptor SpecialEducationSetting
        documentation "The major instructional setting (more than 50 percent of a student's special education program)."
        is optional
    common ServiceProvider
        documentation "The staff providing special education services to the student."
        is optional collection
    shared decimal HoursPerWeek named SpecialEducationHoursPerWeek
        documentation "The number of hours per week for special education instruction and therapy."
        is optional
    shared decimal HoursPerWeek named SchoolHoursPerWeek
        documentation "Indicate the total number of hours of instructional time per week for the school that the student attends."
        is optional    
    bool ShortenedSchoolDayIndicator
        documentation "Indicator that the student's IEP requires a shortened school day."
        is optional    
    shared decimal HoursPerWeek named ReductionInHoursPerWeekComparedToPeers
        documentation "Records the number of hours reduced for the shortened school day for the IEP student as compared to peers in regular education." 
        is optional        
    bool MultiplyDisabled
        documentation "Indicates whether the student receiving special education and related services has been designated as multiply disabled by the admission, review, and dismissal committee as aligned with federal requirements."
        is optional
    bool MedicallyFragile
        documentation "Indicates whether the student receiving special education and related services is: 1) in the age range of birth to 22 years, and 2) has a serious, ongoing illness or a chronic condition that has lasted or is anticipated to last at least 12 or more months or has required at least one month of hospitalization, and that requires daily, ongoing medical treatments and monitoring by appropriately trained personnel which may include parents or other family members, and 3) requires the routine use of medical device or of assistive technology to compensate for the loss of usefulness of a body function needed to participate in activities of daily living, and 4) lives with ongoing threat to his or her continued well-being. Aligns with federal requirements."
        is optional        
    date IEPLastEvaluationDate
        documentation "The date of the last special education evaluation."
        is optional
    date IEPLastReviewDate
        documentation "The date of the last IEP review."
        is optional        
    date IEPEvaluationDueDate
        documentation "The due date for the next special education evaluation."
        is optional
    date IEPReviewDueDate
        documentation "The due date for the next IEP review."
        is optional
    date IEPBeginDate
        documentation "The effective date of the most recent IEP.  Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is optional
    date IEPEndDate
        documentation "The end date of the most recent IEP.  Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is optional
    common Disability
        documentation "The disability condition(s) that best describes an individual's impairment, as related to special education services received."
        is optional collection
    common SpecialEducationProgramService
        documentation "Indicates the service(s) being provided to the student by the special education program."
        is optional collection
    date SpecialEducationExitDate
        documentation "The  month, day and year on which a person stops receiving special education services."
        is optional
    descriptor SpecialEducationExitReason
        documentation "The reason why a person stops receiving special education services."
        is optional
    shared string SpecialEducationExitExplained
        documentation "Explanation on why a person stops receiving special education services."
        is optional 
    common ResponsibleContact
        documentation "Identifies a contact’s responsibility to the student in the special education program, effective as of the begin date."
        is optional collection